    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "C4780BFDD2B293E3",
      "text": "Du bist nicht nur Champ, sondern stehst hier als\\nVertretung des Top-Champs vor mir.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "C4780AFDD2B29230",
      "text": "Wenn du mal in mein Alter kommst, wirst du\\nsehen, wie schnell die Zeit an einem vorbeizieht.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "C47811FDD2B29E15",
      "text": "Sentimentale Vibes passen aber so gar nicht zu\\nmir... Queen Etta is in the house, das sag ich dir![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "C47810FDD2B29C62",
      "text": "Let’s go! Ich zeig dir gleich, was geht! ♪\\nEin ernster Kampf, der den Geist belebt! ♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "C4780FFDD2B29AAF",
      "text": "Zeig mir die Power, die in euch Youngstern\\nsteckt! ♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "C4780EFDD2B298FC",
      "text": "Ich bring deine Seele zum Beben, mal schauen,\\nwie dir das schmeckt! ♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "C47815FDD2B2A4E1",
      "text": "Hahaha! Was für ein Kampf! Du teilst ganz\\nschön aus![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "C47814FDD2B2A32E",
      "text": "Du hast mich durch den Mixer gejagt, als wär\\nich ein Smoothie.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "C47487FDD2AF7DC0",
      "text": "Sorry, dass ich dich vorhin als Rookie\\nbezeichnet hab.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_11",
      "hash64": "C47488FDD2AF7F73",
      "text": "Ich wollte Sagaria so dringend zeigen, was alles\\nin Geister-Pokémon steckt, dass ich ganz aus dem\\r\\nFlow geraten bin, als du hier ankamst.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_12",
      "hash64": "C47489FDD2AF8126",
      "text": "Deine Vibes sind voll legitim, yo! Das kann ich\\nbezeugen.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_13",
      "hash64": "C4748AFDD2AF82D9",
      "text": "Von jetzt an stehe ich immer hinter dir, du hast\\nmein Wort.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_14",
      "hash64": "C4748BFDD2AF848C",
      "text": "Gehen dir Trainer oder Gespenster auf den\\nGeist? Verzweifle nich’! ♪\\c\\nEin Anruf genügt und Queen Etta ist gleich da\\nfür dich! ♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
